{"id":"604896","name":"麻薯欧包","author":"°ZWH","authorId":"11170916","desc":"","cover":"images/604896/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"350g"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"50g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"3g"},{"name":"可可粉","amount":"16g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"110g"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"30g"}],"sub":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"120g"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"40g"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"50g"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"15g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"200g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"g高筋粉+50g白砂糖+3g盐+16g可可粉+5g酵母，混合均匀。","img":"images/604896/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加三个鸡蛋约110g搅匀。加清水约70g搅拌均匀。","img":"images/604896/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加30g黄油，开始揉面。","img":"images/604896/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"做麻薯：120g糯米粉+40g玉米淀粉+50g白砂糖+15g黄油+200g牛奶搅匀，过筛，装入盘中。盖保鲜膜，水沸腾后上锅中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/604896/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面团揉好了。","img":"images/604896/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"移至案板上反复折叠揉搓。","img":"images/604896/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉十几分钟至出手套膜。","img":"images/604896/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"密封饧发。","img":"images/604896/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"麻薯略搅拌便于散热。","img":"images/604896/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"麻薯不烫时揉成长条。","img":"images/604896/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"麻薯四等分，包保鲜膜备用。","img":"images/604896/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"面团已饧发至两倍大。","img":"images/604896/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"按压排气，搓成长条。","img":"images/604896/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"四等分。","img":"images/604896/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"麻薯沾面粉擀成长方形。","img":"images/604896/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"面剂子沾干免费擀成长方形。","img":"images/604896/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"麻薯叠上去，按实。","img":"images/604896/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放水果丁。","img":"images/604896/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放红枣丁。","img":"images/604896/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放葡萄干。","img":"images/604896/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"从一侧卷起。","img":"images/604896/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"两遍收口捏紧折叠到底下。","img":"images/604896/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"二次刑法至1.5倍大。","img":"images/604896/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"洒干面粉，与此同时烤箱170度预热10分钟。","img":"images/604896/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"割花。","img":"images/604896/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"烤箱预热好后，170度中层上线烤三十分钟。","img":"images/604896/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/604896/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"切开享用美味。","img":"images/604896/step_28.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}